{"name":"Harvest Dance","hex":"#a5997c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"harvest","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The process of gathering the ripened crop; harvesting.","The yield of harvesting, i.e., the gathered crops or fruits."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To bring in a harvest; reap; glean.","To take a living organism as part of a managed process to gather food or resources, often with the intention of maintaining a healthy population."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/harvest"},{"term":"dance","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A sequence of rhythmic steps or movements usually performed to music, for pleasure or as a form of social interaction.","A social gathering where dancing is the main activity."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To move with rhythmic steps or movements, especially in time to music.","To leap or move lightly and rapidly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dance"}],"entries":[{"title":"Harvest","blocks":[{"text":"Harvesting is the process of collecting plants, animals, or fish as food, especially the process of gathering mature crops, and \"the harvest\" also refers to the collected crops. Reaping is the cutting of grain or pulses for harvest, typically using a scythe, sickle, or reaper. On smaller farms with minimal mechanization, harvesting is the most labor-intensive activity of the growing season. On large mechanized farms, harvesting uses farm machinery, such as the combine harvester. Automation has increased the efficiency of both the seeding and harvesting processes. Specialized harvesting equipment, using conveyor belts for gentle gripping and mass transport, replaces the manual task of removing each seedling by hand. The term \"harvesting\" in general usage may include immediate postharvest handling, including cleaning, sorting, packing, and cooling."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Agriculture_in_Volgograd_Oblast_002.JPG/330px-Agriculture_in_Volgograd_Oblast_002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harvest","wikidata":"Q213753"},{"title":"Dance","blocks":[{"text":"Dance is an art form, consisting of sequences of body movements with aesthetic and often symbolic value, either improvised or purposefully selected. Dance can be categorized and described by its choreography, by its repertoire of movements or by its historical period or place of origin. Dance is typically performed with musical accompaniment, and sometimes with the dancer simultaneously using a musical instrument themselves."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Two_dancers.jpg/330px-Two_dancers.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dance","wikidata":"Q11639"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Harvest_Straw_Bales_in_Schleswig-Holstein.jpg/500px-Harvest_Straw_Bales_in_Schleswig-Holstein.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Harvest_Straw_Bales_in_Schleswig-Holstein.jpg/1280px-Harvest_Straw_Bales_in_Schleswig-Holstein.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Harvest_Straw_Bales_in_Schleswig-Holstein.jpg/500px-Harvest_Straw_Bales_in_Schleswig-Holstein.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Straw in a field in Schleswig-Holstein, Germany.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHarvest_Straw_Bales_in_Schleswig-Holstein.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/A_man_and_his_donkey_on_the_way_back_from_the_field_in_Aswan%2C_Egypt_%28edited%29.jpg/500px-A_man_and_his_donkey_on_the_way_back_from_the_field_in_Aswan%2C_Egypt_%28e